  "content": "<p><span style=\"font-size:24px;color:#f00\"><strong>本模组仅适用于 1.20.4 - 1.21.1。针对 NeoForge 的更新版本已<a style=\"color:#f00\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/yungs-better-desert-temples\" rel=\"nofollow\">转移至此</a>。</strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/NedZCVu.png\" alt=\"YUNG&#x27;s Better Desert Temples\" width=\"1344\" height=\"416\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/yungs-api-neoforge\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://tinyurl.com/yungsapibadge\" alt=\"Depends on YUNG&#x27;s API\" width=\"211\" height=\"26\"></a>&nbsp;<a href=\"https://discord.gg/rns3beq\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://tinyurl.com/yungsdiscordbadge2\" alt=\"Join the YUNG GANG on Discord!\" width=\"136\" height=\"28\"></a>&nbsp;<a href=\"https://twitter.com/yungnickyoung\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://tinyurl.com/yungstwitterbadge3\" alt=\"Follow me on Twitter!\" width=\"76\" height=\"27\"></a>&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCmEhjcMNhSDTRJgjVfbs9Rw\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://tinyurl.com/yungsyoutubebadge\" alt=\"Subscribe to my YouTube!\" width=\"80\" height=\"30\"></a>&nbsp;<a href=\"https://patreon.com/yungnickyoung\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://tinyurl.com/yungspatreonbadge\" alt=\"Support me on Patreon!\" width=\"138\" height=\"28\"></a></p>\n<p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/2HNgRET.png\" alt=\"What is this?\" width=\"1125\" height=\"59\"></p>\n<p> Minecraft 沙漠神殿的终极升级！YUNG 的更好沙漠神殿重新设计了原版沙漠神殿，使其更加令人兴奋，增加了各种新的谜题、陷阱和跑酷挑战。当然，为了这些挑战，你也能获得比原版沙漠神殿更丰厚的战利品！</p>\n<p>默认情况下，所有进入更好沙漠神殿的玩家都会受到挖掘疲劳效果的影响。一旦你清空了神殿（即杀死神殿尽头的法老），该神殿的挖掘疲劳效果将被永久解除！你可以在配置文件中禁用此功能。此外，你也可以在配置文件中重新启用原版沙漠神殿，使其与更好沙漠神殿同时生成。</p>\n<p><strong><span><iframe allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/C1C5Z0DaOQk?wmode=transparent\" height=\"358\" width=\"638\"></iframe></span></strong></p>\n<p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/JR6R3uf.png\" alt=\"Compatibility\" width=\"1125\" height=\"59\"></p>\n<p>YUNG 的更好沙漠神殿旨在与每个世界生成模组完全兼容，包括：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/yungs-better-strongholds-neoforge\" rel=\"nofollow\">YUNG 的更好要塞</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/yungs-better-mineshafts-neoforge\" rel=\"nofollow\">YUNG 的更好矿井</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/yungs-better-dungeons-neoforge\" rel=\"nofollow\">YUNG 的更好地牢</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/yungs-extras-neoforge\" rel=\"nofollow\">YUNG 的额外内容</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/yungs-bridges-neoforge\" rel=\"nofollow\">YUNG 的桥梁</a></li>\n<li>Repurposed Structures。RS 还提供自定义数据包，你可以将其与模组配合使用，以增加这些沙漠神殿的再利用版本！<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/repurposed-structures-better-desert-temples-compat\" rel=\"nofollow\">在此查看。</a></li>\n</ul>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fessential.gg%252fx%252fyung\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/2mVOWMC.jpeg\" alt=\"\" width=\"1230\" height=\"241\"></a></p>\n<p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/a49IMQJ.png\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbisecthosting.com%252fyung\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/nQRs7ZP.png\" alt=\"Use code YUNGNICKYOUNG with Bisect Hosting for 25% off!\" width=\"1344\" height=\"400\"></a></p>",
